      "message": "What\u0027s the difference between --lib and --classpath?  Compiling for the platform is more complicated than just android.jar.  For platform modules we have core-oj:core-libart on the bootclasspath containing the java.* classes, and framework.jar and shared libraries on the classpath containing android.* and app library classes.",
